{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["Is the feedback for the speaker's own growth, or for an organiser choosing next year's speakers? Organisers may want the see-again question most.","Was the talk streamed or recorded? If it was only in person, remove the viewing question and the online problems that follow it.","Should people name the session, or will you send a separate link per talk with the name prefilled?","Who will answer the unasked questions, and how soon?"],"howToUseResponses":"Start with the follow question and the notes from people who lost the thread: if several point to the same moment, that section needs reworking before anything else. Use the delivery grid to separate how the talk was given from what was in it, and compare online viewers with people in the room, since sound and slide problems often only hit one group. Reply to every open question, and pick two concrete changes for the next time the talk is given.","customizeSteps":["Rename the delivery grid rows if the talk had no slides, or included a demo or hands-on exercise.","Add the session name as a hidden field on each link so attendees of a multi-talk event skip the first question.","Put the link or a QR code on the last slide and in the recording's description, and give the room a minute to answer before people leave."],"faqs":[{"q":"What should I ask on a presentation feedback survey?","a":"Whether people could follow the talk, whether it delivered what it promised, how relevant it was, and how the speaker did on sound, pace, slides and questions. One open question about what to change gives the speaker something to act on."},{"q":"When should I send a presentation feedback survey?","a":"Before people leave, or within the hour. Show the link on the closing slide so they can answer on their phone."},{"q":"How do I get feedback from people who watched online?","a":"Share the same link in the stream chat and with the recording. This survey asks how each person watched, so you can read online and in-room answers separately."},{"q":"Can the feedback be anonymous?","a":"Yes. The survey only asks for an email if the person wants a reply from the speaker."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":10,"title":"Presentation feedback survey","description":"Hear whether the audience could follow the talk and how the delivery landed.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_presenta00","ref":"welcome","title":"Thanks for coming to the talk. Two minutes of honest feedback would help the speaker a lot.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_presenta01","ref":"talk","title":"Which talk or session are you giving feedback on?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":120},{"id":"blk_presenta02","ref":"attended_how","title":"How did you watch it?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_in_the_room","label":"In the room","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_online_live","label":"Online, live","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_watched_the_recording","label":"Watched the recording","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_presenta03","ref":"online_issues","title":"Did anything get in the way of watching online?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"multi_select","options":[{"id":"opt_the_sound_was","label":"The sound was hard to hear","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_the_slides_were","label":"The slides were hard to read on screen","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_the_video_froze","label":"The video froze or lagged","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_couldn_t","label":"I couldn't ask a question","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_no_problems","label":"No problems","image_key":null}],"minSelections":1,"maxSelections":5,"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_presenta04","ref":"matched_promise","title":"Did the talk deliver what its title and description promised?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_yes","label":"Yes","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_mostly","label":"Mostly","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_not_really","label":"Not really","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_presenta05","ref":"relevance","title":"How relevant was the content to your work or interests?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"opinion_scale","steps":5,"startAt":1,"labelLow":"Not relevant","labelHigh":"Spot on"},{"id":"blk_presenta06","ref":"follow","title":"How much of the talk could you follow?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_all_of_it","label":"All of it","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_most_of_it","label":"Most of it","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_about_half","label":"About half","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_lost_the","label":"I lost the thread early","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_presenta07","ref":"lost_thread","title":"Roughly where did you lose the thread, and what would have helped you keep up?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_presenta08","ref":"delivery","title":"How did the speaker do on each of these?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"matrix","rows":[{"id":"opt_row_easy_to","label":"Easy to hear and understand"},{"id":"opt_row_spoke_at","label":"Spoke at a comfortable pace"},{"id":"opt_row_slides_were","label":"Slides were readable and helped"},{"id":"opt_row_kept_my","label":"Kept my attention"},{"id":"opt_row_handled_questions","label":"Handled questions well"}],"columns":[{"id":"opt_col_poor","label":"Poor"},{"id":"opt_col_fair","label":"Fair"},{"id":"opt_col_good","label":"Good"},{"id":"opt_col_excellent","label":"Excellent"}],"multiplePerRow":false},{"id":"blk_presenta09","ref":"see_again","title":"Would you go to another talk by this speaker?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_yes","label":"Yes","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_maybe","label":"Maybe","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_no","label":"No","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_presenta10","ref":"one_change","title":"If the speaker changed one thing for next time, what should it be?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":600,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_presenta11","ref":"open_question","title":"Is there a question you didn't get to ask?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":600,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_presenta12","ref":"wants_reply","title":"Would you like the speaker to reply to you?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"yes_no","yesLabel":"Yes","noLabel":"No"},{"id":"blk_presenta13","ref":"reply_email","title":"Where should the reply go?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"email","unique":false,"businessOnly":false,"allowedDomains":[],"verify":false}],"endings":[{"id":"end_presenta01","ref":"end_thanks","title":"Thank you for the feedback","bodyMd":"It goes straight to the speaker and shapes the next version of this talk.","imageUrl":null,"redirectDelaySec":4,"showSummary":false,"kind":"success","requirements":[]},{"id":"end_presenta02","ref":"end_reply","title":"Got it, a reply is on its way ✉️","bodyMd":"The speaker will get back to you by email. Thanks for taking the time.","imageUrl":null,"redirectDelaySec":4,"showSummary":false